{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/extras/a31cbee9168e78c895667809d2b3104f.avif?t=1754060000\" width=600 height=88 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/extras/c1ba13b250d5ae29db3356934735ebc7.webp?t=1754060000\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/extras/c1ba13b250d5ae29db3356934735ebc7.poster.webp?t=1754060000\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a relaxing yet mind-bending journey through thousands of uniquely designed mazes. From classic square puzzles to complex circular, triangular, and even hexagonal labyrinths\u2014experience a truly diverse and enchanting experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path through combinations of maze shapes, sizes, and game modes. Whether you're looking for a calming puzzle break or a strategic challenge, there's something here for every mood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Creative Level Design: Conquer 4 maze types\u2014square, circular, triangular, and hexagonal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 5 Unique Challenges: Classic, Portal, Token, Limited Moves, Timed and Dark Mazes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Power-ups: 3 helpful powers to help you find your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Satisfying puzzles: Enjoy a peaceful session with small mazes, or test your skills on advanced ones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique Shapes: Explore mazes shaped like fish, guitars, trees, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Beautiful Design: Vivid colors and soothing music create a visually and emotionally engaging experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock constellations of puzzles, discover secret paths, and lose yourself in the ultimate maze adventure.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Born in Angles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3795750/9f189803644aa8f408b1385abff1d857294bf3a7.jpg"},{"name":"Stuck in Grid","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3795750/8e7d67eff9749b3565f4e94b2626c26333591cf0.jpg"},{"name":"Held in Loop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3795750/905b63b0fe4f8eb2463e39b9ed6b57ea8663a660.jpg"},{"name":"Dimensional Drift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3795750/107f65cbdbff09f1d642d4185f290df63233d1c5.jpg"},{"name":"Into the Unseen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3795750/2237192a33c43240356cf29718035bb114a4fb37.jpg"},{"name":"Fading Seconds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3795750/740eb91e8ab5eae7255176adacf269cd7db35a27.jpg"},{"name":"Measured Moves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3795750/384bacd27b673aaf54a47ba77c0e224cbeb27878.jpg"},{"name":"Broken Passage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3795750/a3474432321e7a07168536a3a1f0fedcb9817353.jpg"},{"name":"Race the Darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3795750/ecf4df24d18b35d16310735bd06d3f05c7f55de1.jpg"},{"name":"Constellation Seeker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3795750/343a2f9b31fa24b8cc75619acf7117cd9bc6a6ee.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3795750?t=1754060000","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/649fdee4108dc9fd274946c0d7c8c14d4b1118a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754060000","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/3718ee006c2938c61a367552aaf55dccf9ce1b82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754060000","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/3718ee006c2938c61a367552aaf55dccf9ce1b82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754060000","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/extras/a31cbee9168e78c895667809d2b3104f.avif?t=1754060000\" width=600 height=88 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/extras/c1ba13b250d5ae29db3356934735ebc7.webp?t=1754060000\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/extras/c1ba13b250d5ae29db3356934735ebc7.poster.webp?t=1754060000\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a relaxing yet mind-bending journey through thousands of uniquely designed mazes. From classic square puzzles to complex circular, triangular, and even hexagonal labyrinths\u2014experience a truly diverse and enchanting experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path through combinations of maze shapes, sizes, and game modes. Whether you're looking for a calming puzzle break or a strategic challenge, there's something here for every mood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Creative Level Design: Conquer 4 maze types\u2014square, circular, triangular, and hexagonal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 5 Unique Challenges: Classic, Portal, Token, Limited Moves, Timed and Dark Mazes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Power-ups: 3 helpful powers to help you find your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Satisfying puzzles: Enjoy a peaceful session with small mazes, or test your skills on advanced ones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique Shapes: Explore mazes shaped like fish, guitars, trees, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Beautiful Design: Vivid colors and soothing music create a visually and emotionally engaging experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock constellations of puzzles, discover secret paths, and lose yourself in the ultimate maze adventure.</p>","developers":["Infinity Games, Lda"],"dlc":[3796090,3796100,3796110,3796120],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/3bb87cd3b5e288fc4fcc8827db1eaaf96469b39c/header.jpg?t=1754060000","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 QubicGames S.A.<br />\r\n\u00a9 2020 Infinity Games, Lda","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3795750/1178179529/da013c5df7095c431d7f1e27c0469cb486f0e9e8/1750947622/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752763931","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3795750/1178179529/da013c5df7095c431d7f1e27c0469cb486f0e9e8/1750947622/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752763931","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3795750/1178179529/da013c5df7095c431d7f1e27c0469cb486f0e9e8/1750947622/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752763931","id":257161890,"name":"Maze: Path of Light - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/